    "stem": "You need to assign permissions for the data store in the AnalyticsPOC workspace. The solution must meet the security requirements.\nWhich additional permissions should you assign when you share the data store? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.",
    "blanks": [
