    "stem": "You have a Fabric tenant that contains a semantic model named Model1. Model1 uses Import mode. Model1 contains a table named Orders.\nOrders has 100 million rows and the following fields.\nYou need to reduce the memory used by Model1 and the time it takes to refresh the model.\nWhich two actions should you perform? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.\nNOTE: Each correct answer is worth one point.",
    "options": [
