    "remaining": "R11 second-pass review not performed; retained R10 finding is a lead, not new verification.",
    "explanation": "**Viewer — Contributor.** Map each requirement onto the workspace-role capability table, then take the **lowest** role that satisfies it (the case study demands least privilege).\n\n| Capability | Viewer | Contributor | Member | Admin |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| **Read lakehouse/warehouse data and shortcuts via SQL analytics endpoint** | ✔ | ✔ | ✔ | ✔ |\n| **Read lakehouse data via Lakehouse explorer / Apache Spark** | ✘ | ✔ | ✔ | ✔ |\n\n- **ResearchReviewersGroup1** must *\"read lakehouse and warehouse data and shortcuts **by using SQL endpoints**\"*. **Viewer** already grants that — it is the minimum.\n- **ResearchReviewersGroup2** must *\"read lakehouse data **by using Lakehouse explorer**\"*. Viewer does **not** include OneLake/Spark access, so the lowest role that works is **Contributor**.\n\n**Member** would work for both but grants sharing and re-permissioning rights that neither group needs — a least-privilege violation.",
    "answer": null,
