      "explanation": "The deciding constraint is *\"must support **Power Query M formula language** expressions\"*. Power Query M is the language of **Dataflow Gen2**, and a pipeline can run one through the **Dataflow activity**.\n\n- **D Copy data** – the obvious choice for \"copy CSV files to a lakehouse\", and it is the answer to many similar questions. But Copy has no transformation language at all: it maps columns and moves bytes. No M.\n- **B Notebook** – Python/Scala/SQL/R. Not M.\n- **C Script** – runs a SQL script against a database. Not M, and it cannot read CSV files from storage.\n\nSo the M requirement, not the copy requirement, is what the question is testing."
