    "id": "T1Q87",
    "type": "mcq",
    "stem": "You have a Microsoft Power BI semantic model.\nYou need to identify any surrogate key columns in the model that have the Summarize By property set to a value other than to None. The solution\nmust minimize effort.\nWhat should you use?",
    "options": [
