    "reviewNote": "Replaced automatic synchronization premise with explicit model table selection.",
    "remaining": "",
    "explanation": "B explicitly manages the model table selection. Disabling query caching, refreshing existing model tables, and marking the lakehouse discoverable do not automatically extend the model schema. The original retired auto-sync setting is preserved only in the immutable source.",
    "answer": "B",
    "officialAnswer": "B",
    "original": {
