    "stem": "You have a Fabric tenant that contains a workspace named Workspace1. Workspace1 uses Pro license mode and contains a semantic model\nnamed Model1.\nYou need to ensure that Model1 supports XMLA connections.\nWhich setting should modify?",
    "options": [
