      "answer": "B",
      "stem": "You have a query in Microsoft Power BI Desktop that contains two columns named Order_Date and Shipping_Date.\nYou need to create a column that will calculate the number of days between Order_Date and Shipping_Date for each row.\nWhich Power Query function should you use?",
