        "title": "Original KQL completion template",
        "language": "kql",
        "content": "Readings\n| filter City == \"Copenhagen\"\n| sort by Datetime\n[Dropdown 1] PrevMeterReading = prev(MeterReading),\n             PrevTimestamp = prev(Datetime)\n[Dropdown 2] City, Area, MeterReading, Datetime,\n             PrevMeterReading, PrevDatetime"
