  {
    "id": "T1Q202",
    "type": "dragdrop",
    "stem": "You have three Fabric workspaces named Workspace1, Workspace2, and Workspace3. Workspace1 contains a report named Report1 and a\nsemantic model named Model1 in Import mode.\nYou perform the following actions:\n• Create a deployment pipeline named Pipeline1 that has three stages named development, test, and production.\n• Assign Workspace1 to the development stage of Pipeline1.\n• Assign Workspace2 to the test stage of Pipeline1.\n• Assign Workspace3 to the production stage of Pipeline1.\n• Modify Model1.\nYou need to ensure that changes to Model1 are available in the production stage as quickly as possible. The solution must NOT affect the\navailability of Report1.\nWhich three actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and\narrange them in the correct order.",
    "drag": {
      "items": [
        "Refresh Model1 in the test stage.",
        "Run Pipeline1 from the development stage to the test stage.",
        "Refresh Model1 in the development stage.",
        "Run Pipeline1 from the test stage to the production stage.",
        "Refresh Model1 in the production stage."
      ],
      "reuse": false,
