    "reviewNote": "The documented granular access sequence starts with base sharing.",
    "remaining": "",
    "explanation": "B is the first step of the documented workflow: share with base Read/CONNECT, then issue GRANT SELECT ON OBJECT::dbo.TargetTable TO [User1]. A grants access across the workspace. C describes the subsequent granular SQL step without first providing Fabric item access. D permits reading all Warehouse tables, exceeding the stated scope.",
